      {
       "id": "9c9ae67",
       "elType": "widget",
       "widgetType": "toggle",
       "settings": {
        "tabs": [
         {
          "_id": "3b09e8d",
          "tab_title": "Which domain extension should I choose?",
          "tab_content": "<p>For most Western Australian businesses a .com.au is the safe choice. It tells customers you're a local business. Many also register the matching .com so nobody else can take it.</p><p>Not sure? Send us your business name and we'll suggest the best domain and extension, free of charge.</p>"
         },
         {
          "_id": "b4093ad",
          "tab_title": "How does transferring a domain to you work?",
          "tab_content": "<p>We handle the whole transfer for you: no downtime, no lost email and no chasing transfer codes (EPP codes) yourself. We manage it from your current domain provider (registrar), start to finish.</p><p>Send us a quick enquiry and our Perth team will scope the transfer, usually the same day.</p>"
         },
         {
          "_id": "7bc6733",
          "tab_title": "What is WHOIS privacy protection?",
          "tab_content": "<p>It hides your personal details from the public domain register (WHOIS). It's only available on international extensions (TLDs) like .com, .net and .org. Australian .au domains don't offer it.</p>"
         },
         {
          "_id": "4d7bbdd",
          "tab_title": "Will you remind me before my domain expires?",
          "tab_content": "<p>Yes. We send renewal reminders so your domain never quietly expires.</p>"
         },
         {
          "_id": "90a1978",
          "tab_title": "Can I bundle a domain with hosting or email?",
          "tab_content": "<p>Yes. Hosting, domains and email are all looked after by the same Perth team, and we connect your domain to your hosting or email for you.</p>"
         }
        ],
        "selected_icon": {
         "value": "fas fa-plus",
         "library": "fa-solid"
        },
        "selected_active_icon": {
         "value": "fas fa-minus",
         "library": "fa-solid"
        },
        "icon_align": "right",
        "title_html_tag": "h3",
        "faq_schema": "yes",
        "_css_classes": "pwh-faq"
